  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "slideset",
      "source": "canonical",
      "slides": [
        {
          "title": "See who has it",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Tap <strong>Drones</strong>, then <strong>Requests</strong>. <strong>My requests</strong> says what became of each request, and <strong>With 2R/1J, no plan yet</strong> means a team has it.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/95d08999e5ff99fa.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Read it in the Inbox",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Open <strong>Inbox</strong>. Under <strong>Sent</strong>, the row says where your request stands.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/3bb554ffef09d47f.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "See it fly",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Open <strong>Drones</strong> and tap <strong>Missions</strong>. <strong>Active</strong> lists every drone flying now and how far each target is from you.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/2f8a91d3c723ad21.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Get the result",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>When the team reports, open <strong>Inbox</strong> again. The <strong>Sent</strong> row gives the result.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/852d1735fb056d89.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "See finished missions",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>In <strong>Missions</strong>, tap <strong>Finished</strong>. Each row starts with how it ended, such as <strong>Hit</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/7293e1b0335edc68.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Open the mission",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Tap the mission to see how it went. The team's comment is last.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/1d156bcb4a530e58.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
